{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 33,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 231.606,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, cannot write all the things which were taught among my people;",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.242,
      "end": 7.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither am I mighty in writing,",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.512,
      "end": 9.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like unto speaking;",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.317,
      "end": 12.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for when a man speaketh by the power of the Holy Ghost",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.026,
      "end": 17.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the power of the Holy Ghost carrieth it unto the hearts of the children of men.",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.886,
      "end": 22.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, there are many that harden their hearts against the Holy Spirit,",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.524,
      "end": 24.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it hath no place in them;",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.654,
      "end": 28.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they cast many things away which are written",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.549,
      "end": 31.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and esteem them as things of naught.",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.69,
      "end": 35.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I, Nephi, have written what I have written,",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.307,
      "end": 37.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I esteem it as of great worth,",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.902,
      "end": 39.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and especially unto my people.",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 39.986,
      "end": 42.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I pray continually for them by day,",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 42.627,
      "end": 46.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and mine eyes water my pillow by night, because of them;",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.197,
      "end": 48.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I cry unto my God in faith,",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.653,
      "end": 50.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that he will hear my cry.",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 51.516,
      "end": 54.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I know that the Lord God will consecrate my prayers",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 54.854,
      "end": 56.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the gain of my people.",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.984,
      "end": 59.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the words which I have written in weakness",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 60.136,
      "end": 62.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will be made strong unto them;",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 62.452,
      "end": 65.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it persuadeth them to do good;",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 65.465,
      "end": 68.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it maketh known unto them of their fathers;",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 68.478,
      "end": 70.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it speaketh of Jesus,",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 70.376,
      "end": 72.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and persuadeth them to believe in him,",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 72.878,
      "end": 75.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to endure to the end, which is life eternal.",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 76.53,
      "end": 81.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it speaketh harshly against sin, according to the plainness of the truth;",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 81.633,
      "end": 86.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, no man will be angry at the words which I have written",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 86.55,
      "end": 89.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save he shall be of the spirit of the devil.",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 89.877,
      "end": 91.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I glory in plainness;",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 91.636,
      "end": 93.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I glory in truth;",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 93.302,
      "end": 95.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I glory in my Jesus,",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 95.2,
      "end": 97.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he hath redeemed my soul from hell.",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 98.248,
      "end": 100.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have charity for my people,",
      "verse": "33:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 100.518,
      "end": 102.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great faith in Christ",
      "verse": "33:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 102.463,
      "end": 106.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I shall meet many souls spotless at his judgment-seat.",
      "verse": "33:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 106.812,
      "end": 108.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have charity for the Jew\u2014",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 108.803,
      "end": 111.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say Jew, because I mean them from whence I came.",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 112.455,
      "end": 114.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I also have charity for the Gentiles.",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 115.003,
      "end": 117.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, for none of these can I hope",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 117.598,
      "end": 120.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they shall be reconciled unto Christ,",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 120.472,
      "end": 122.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and enter into the narrow gate,",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 123.067,
      "end": 126.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and walk in the strait path which leads to life,",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 126.73,
      "end": 131.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in the path until the end of the day of probation.",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 131.775,
      "end": 133.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 133.998,
      "end": 135.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Jew,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 135.525,
      "end": 137.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all ye ends of the earth,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 137.795,
      "end": 140.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hearken unto these words and believe in Christ;",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 141.04,
      "end": 144.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye believe not in these words believe in Christ.",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 144.517,
      "end": 146.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if ye shall believe in Christ",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 146.973,
      "end": 148.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will believe in these words,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 149.15,
      "end": 151.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are the words of Christ,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 151.466,
      "end": 153.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath given them unto me;",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 154.107,
      "end": 157.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they teach all men that they should do good.",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 157.806,
      "end": 160.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if they are not the words of Christ,",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 160.215,
      "end": 161.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "judge ye\u2014",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 161.51,
      "end": 164.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for Christ will show unto you, with power and great glory,",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 164.941,
      "end": 167.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they are his words, at the last day;",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 167.397,
      "end": 170.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and you and I shall stand face to face before his bar;",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 170.781,
      "end": 173.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall know that I have been commanded of him",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 173.794,
      "end": 175.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to write these things,",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 175.599,
      "end": 177.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding my weakness.",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 177.997,
      "end": 180.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I pray the Father in the name of Christ",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 180.638,
      "end": 182.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that many of us,",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 182.351,
      "end": 183.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if not all,",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 183.785,
      "end": 186.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "may be saved in his kingdom at that great and last day.",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 187.484,
      "end": 189.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 189.707,
      "end": 192.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all those who are of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 192.673,
      "end": 194.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all ye ends of the earth,",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 194.943,
      "end": 198.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I speak unto you as the voice of one crying from the dust:",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 198.885,
      "end": 201.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Farewell until that great day shall come.",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 202.073,
      "end": 205.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And you that will not partake of the goodness of God,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 205.272,
      "end": 207.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and respect the words of the Jews,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 207.728,
      "end": 209.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my words,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 209.301,
      "end": 214.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the words which shall proceed forth out of the mouth of the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 214.218,
      "end": 217.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I bid you an everlasting farewell,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 217.37,
      "end": 220.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for these words shall condemn you at the last day.",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 221.301,
      "end": 222.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For what I seal on earth,",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 223.153,
      "end": 226.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be brought against you at the judgment bar;",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 226.212,
      "end": 228.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus hath the Lord commanded me,",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 228.482,
      "end": 229.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I must obey.",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 230.102,
      "end": 230.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 83
    }
  ]
}